{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"11":"The Rites of Hajj (Kitab Al-Manasik Wa'l-Hajj)"},"section_detail":{"11":{"hadithnumber_first":1721,"hadithnumber_last":2045,"arabicnumber_first":1721,"arabicnumber_last":2045,"name_native":"كتاب المناسك والحج"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1962,"arabicnumber":1962,"text":"حدثنا هناد بن السري، عن ابي الاحوص، عن المغيرة، عن ابراهيم، قال ان عثمان صلى اربعا لانه اتخذها وطنا","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":11,"hadith":242}}]}